x11shift (1.1.6-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Retain native LUT calibration in the X11 session before adjusting colors.
  * Recover from leftover night tint after an interrupted process, including
    when starting disabled, instead of capturing it as the original colors.
  * Preserve independently changed color profiles during restart recovery.
  * Cover daylight recovery, disabled startup, and interrupted LUT updates.

 -- X11Shift Developers <maintainers@x11shift.invalid>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 09:30:00 -0500

x11shift (1.1.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Use native GAMMA_LUT output properties when available so color changes
    reach the GPU on AMD Xorg sessions with ineffective legacy gamma writes.
  * Preserve native calibration across toggles, reconnects, and shutdown.
  * Reset both native lookup tables and legacy gamma ramps with --reset.

 -- X11Shift Developers <maintainers@x11shift.invalid>  Fri, 09 Oct 2026 22:52:00 -0500

